data: {"id": "3b7c23075ac642ec-thinking-parallel_evidence-1441", "run_id": "3b7c23075ac642ec", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "已采集事实、冲突与缺口说明：\n\n## 事实\n- **身份与生命周期**：Pod `workload-5f4fb9ff45-cfzz6` (UID `3fce1c76-f1ba-4e68-8f05-a50d78a131c9`) 运行在 `node2`，创建时间 2026-09-03T17:53:37Z，未删除，无 restart（`restarts=0`）。\n- **当前状态**：Pod 的 `phase=Running`，但 `Ready=False`，`ContainersReady=False`，reason=`ContainersNotReady`，message=`containers with unready status: [app]`。\n- **探针事件**：kubelet 持续报告 `Readiness probe failed: HTTP probe failed with statuscode: 503`，频率 ~1662 次 / 84 分钟，最近一次在 8s 前。该事件自 Pod 启动后一直持续，无恢复迹象。\n- **应用日志**：`/work` 端点持续返回 `", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 4, "ts_ms": 1788463177858, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

